            </note>
            <note corresp="#d299-f4" n="4" xml:id="d299-f4-content">
                <p>There is an indication on another copy of this memorandum that CIA telegram CSDB
                    312/01196–65, May 12, was attached at Tab B. (Johnson Library, National Security
                    File, Memos to the President, McGeorge Bundy, Vol. X) Tab B was not found
                    attached to either copy of the memorandum and was not found.</p>
            </note>
